875
00:38:01,800 --> 00:38:03,740
Is that clear to all of you?

876
00:38:05,150 --> 00:38:05,940
Remember.

877
00:38:06,150 --> 00:38:08,420
This time, your targets are

878
00:38:09,630 --> 00:38:11,300
everyone here for the trial.

879
