881
00:38:58,700 --> 00:39:04,750
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

882
00:39:05,380 --> 00:39:11,830
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

883
00:39:12,570 --> 00:39:19,690
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

884
00:39:20,070 --> 00:39:26,970
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

885
00:39:27,350 --> 00:39:34,700
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

886
